# Documentation Sync Rule (CRITICAL)

**Rule: Keep Cursor Rules in Sync with Code Changes**

Whenever code changes affect any of the following, update the corresponding rule file:

| Change Type | Update Required |
|-------------|-----------------|
| New command added | `project-context.mdc` Commands Reference |
| New conversation state | `project-context.mdc` Conversation States |
| Google Sheets cell/range changes | `project-context.mdc` Cell References |
| New data model or field | `project-context.mdc` Data Models |
| New expense group/category | `project-context.mdc` Groups/Categories |
| Handler pattern changes | `telegram-bot.mdc` patterns |
| Go coding convention changes | `go-standards.mdc` |

**Location:** `.cursor/rules/`

