# Privacy Rule (CRITICAL)

**Rule: No Personal Data in Documentation**

All documentation and cursor rules MUST use fake/sample data only:

- Fake user IDs: `1234567890`, `9876543210`
- Sample usernames: `@sampleuser`, `@testuser`
- Sample names: `John Doe`, `Jane Smith`
- Placeholder URLs: `https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/SPREADSHEET_ID/...`
- Sample amounts: `50,000`, `100,000`

Never include real Telegram user IDs, usernames, spreadsheet URLs, or production data.
